{"id":"n57461-1-8","stage":5,"title":"몰아치다 · 交加","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57461-1-8-1","ko":"어젯밤에 잠을 한숨도 못 잤어.","zh":"昨晚我一点觉都没睡。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어젯밤에","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"어젯밤：昨夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어젯밤","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67078","senseId":"1","lemma":"어젯밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어젯밤에","audio":"/audio/993b356a7580926fa1bc.mp3"}},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠을","audio":"/audio/76afcb272f116ce8b9ef.mp3"}},{"text":"한숨도","meaning":"一会儿，喘一口气的功夫","explanation":"한숨：一会儿，喘一口气的功夫；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85558","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한숨도","audio":"/audio/87ab8c085dc74311b545.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"잤어.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤어","audio":"/audio/0570fa583804e5424f3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"faa5384e37664674","term":"어젯밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3","entryId":"67078","definition":"昨天的夜晚。","pronunciation":["어제